This licence covers the code in this repository.

The mask pack in masks/ is derived from the MVTec LOCO AD dataset and is
distributed under that dataset's licence, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — research use,
attribution, and share-alike. See masks/README.md.

The MVTec LOCO AD images themselves are not redistributed here.
